  "descriptionMarkdown": "Book containing 4 blueprints for quality spoilage - two blueprints are for mid-game and two are for late game.\n\n#### Mid-game blueprint:\n- Consumes full unstacked green belt of **spoilage**. No bots are needed\n- Can be used to clean bus from spoilage, if desired. Note that it stops taking spoilage when it reach it spoilage quality goals to avoid deadlocks.\n- Items used here are capped by epic quality. You can downgrade as you wish and it will still work, simply slower\n\n#### Mid-game blueprint v2:\n- Much more efficient version for mid-game quality spoilage but also bigger than the first blueprint.\n- Can consumes full unstacked green belt of **spoilage**. No bots are needed\n- Can be used to clean bus from spoilage, if desired. Note that it stops taking spoilage when it reach it spoilage quality goals to avoid deadlocks.\n- Items used here are mostly normal quality. When I put legendary items, it means \"use the best you've got\" and it will still work, simply slower\n\n#### Late-game blueprint:\n- Consumes a blue belt of **jellynut** and some **yumako**. Doesn't use the spoilage from the bus, it creates its own spoilage.\n\n#### Late-game blueprint v2:\n- Much more efficient than the fist late-game quality spoilage blueprint but also a bit bigger. **Use this blueprint if you need maximum quality spoilage.**\n- Consumes a blue belt of **jellynut** and some **yumako**. Doesn't use the spoilage from the bus, it creates its own spoilage.\n\n#### Updates:\n- **2025/Jul/23:** New versions for mid-game v2, late-game and late-game v2 blueprints.\n- **2025/Feb/10:** Added another late-game blueprint to the book.\n- **2025/Feb/09:** Added another mid-game blueprint to the book.",
